 d=E/leaf;r=f'[data-el="crossrail-{leaf}"]';(d/'element.css').write_text(code.replace('@container','__CQ__').replace('@',r).replace('__CQ__','@container')+'\n');(d/'description.md').write_text({'headline':'A restrained body heading uses a firm weight, an optional quiet kicker and one clear supporting line. Large and accent-ground variants retain the same hierarchy.','prose':'Paragraphs use a compact readable baseline, broad shared gaps and limited emphasis. The quiet version gains a fine outline; the column version flows text rather than turning paragraphs into cards.','pill':'A thin capsule holds its mark, name and note on one horizontal line. The outline, quiet and filled variants change the surface without changing the one-line grammar.','card':'A broad panel aligns a prominent figure or circular mark against a right-hand title, with a fine rule and supporting note below. Quiet columns reserve an upper pause for their kicker; outlined cards expose a measured vertical hierarchy.','agenda':'Regular ruled entries place a plain-weight subject opposite a strong right-aligned ordinal. Optional notes remain below their own entry and active entries gain a quiet surface.','list':'Small native markers anchor a clear left text edge. Numbered, checked and ruled variants preserve the same item hierarchy and shared spacing.','metric':'A bare figure sits inside a restrained outline capsule beside its label. Supporting copy and an optional small trend occupy separate lower tracks.','callout':'A single sentence sits on a calm surface with a narrow structural rail. The optional circular icon is kept smaller than the text mass.','quote':'A vertical rule carries the quotation while a circular attribution and two text lines form a quiet signature below.','delta':'Two disciplined capsules compare before and after, joined by a small structural arrow owned by the component.','image-frame':'Two concentric circular edges reserve a quiet picture seat. The frame remains circular inside wide or tall allocations rather than stretching its photograph.','logo-group':'Near-square identity seats form a balanced horizontal row between two fine rules.','person':'A circular portrait leads a centred identity with a compact note. Multiple profiles retain the same alignment and avoid competing surfaces.','pricing':'Strong top rails and simple plan surfaces set a measured hierarchy from name to price to included items. The selected plan uses one clear emphasis surface.'}[leaf]+'\n')
